    "body": "I had a look at switching to use `gix::ThreadSafeRepository::init` but ran in to some challenges due to the expected return type: https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/4d575b62745c06cecf911c63b1e11521739bdb4c/src/test/mod.rs#L174\r\n\r\nSo I'm not sure how easy it would be to utilise `gix::ThreadSafeRepository::init` given the above.\r\nIn addition I've followed the convention of the other fixture providers e.g:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/starship/starship/blob/4d575b62745c06cecf911c63b1e11521739bdb4c/src/test/mod.rs#L191-L199\r\n\r\nLet me know what you think?",
